N.7 Disturbance Propagation Through the ψ-Chain

```
════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
          ψ-CHAIN WITH DISTURBANCE  d(t)  and  BOUND  d̄_j
════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

  ψ₀ = h
   │
   │  ψ₁ = ψ̇₀ + α₁(ψ₀)
   ▼
  ψ̇₀ = L_f h + L_g h u + L_{g_d} h · d
   │
   │  ‖L_{g_d} h · d‖ ≤ ‖L_{g_d} h‖ · d̄₀
   ▼
  ψ₁ ≥ ψ₁^nom − Λ_{1,0} d̄₀
   │
   │  ψ₂ = ψ̇₁ + α₂(ψ₁)
   ▼
  ψ̇₁ = ψ̇₁^nom + Λ̇_{1,0} d̄₀ + Λ_{1,0} ḋ
   │
   │  ‖ḋ‖ ≤ d̄₁
   ▼
  ψ₂ ≥ ψ₂^nom − Λ_{2,0} d̄₀ − Λ_{2,1} d̄₁
   │
   │   ⋮
   ▼
  ψ_{r−1} ≥ ψ_{r−1}^nom − Σ_{j=0}^{r−2} Λ_{r−1,j} d̄_j

  ACCUMULATED BOUND:
    ι(‖d‖_[0,r−1])  =  Σ_{j=0}^{r−2}  ‖Λ_{r−1,j}‖_∞ · d̄_j

  ROBUST HOCBF CONDITION:
    L_f ψ_{r−1} + L_g ψ_{r−1} u + α_r(ψ_{r−1})  ≥  − ι

  Practical:  inflate ι by factor 2 to absorb the comparison-lemma
              constant; fold into numerical margin ε_r.
